This project is a Rust port of Friday Night Funkin'.

Game logic is ported from the Friday Night Funkin' legacy 0.2.8 source code,
and the art, music, sounds and charts in the assets folder come from the
Friday Night Funkin' 0.2.7.1 repository. Both are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Friday Night Funkin' is made by:
  ninjamuffin99 (programming)
  PhantomArcade (animation and art)
  evilsk8r (art)
  kawaisprite (music)
  Moawling (week 6 pixel art)
  BassetFilms (music for Monster)

Pico is created by Tom Fulp. Skid and Pump are created by SrPelo.

Engine behavior is modeled on HaxeFlixel and flixel-addons (MIT License).

The bundled font VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors) is licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1. It stands in for the fonts used by the original game,
which are not included.